'''Mighty Bomburr''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] and [[Best of the Best (Gacha Event)|Best of the Best]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]] increases health and knockbacks. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] increases health and grants [[Omni Strike]], [[Explosion]], [[Sage Slayer]] and [[Immune to Explosions|Explosion Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.5 Update|Version 10.5]], with the exception of the [[Soulstrike]] talent, which was added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]]. They were added into [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

